   "t": 0,
   "text": "Need a quick dribbling game for your next session? Try this one.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Two banks with a river between them, and two crocodiles living in the water.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 3.14,
   "text": "Everyone dribbles bank to bank, one crossing at a time, any gap they like.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 11.71,
   "text": "The crocodiles can only tackle inside the river, so pick your moment and go.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 14.28,
   "text": "Widen the river so crossings take longer and crocodiles get more time.",
   "hold": 2.5,
